---
const facts = [
  ['School', 'the school Kingswood, Class of 2027'],
  ['Where', 'Detroit area, Michigan'],
  ['Languages', 'English, Mandarin, Swift, TypeScript, Python'],
  ['Sport', 'Climbing, speed and bouldering'],
  ['Before that', 'Two years of varsity cross country. VEX Worlds as a freshman'],
  ['Next', 'Business with a CS minor. Building the whole way through'],
];
---
<section class="section about" id="about" data-accent="#f25c1f" data-face="(｡•ᴗ•｡)">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about-txt">
      <h2 class="t-head reveal">About</h2>
      <p class="t-lead reveal about-p">
        I taught myself most of what I know from documentation and from shipping things
        that broke. Robotics came first, VEX Worlds as a freshman and then founding the
        school’s FRC team. Software came after, and it stuck. Away from the keyboard I
        climb, carry a camera, and speak Mandarin at home. Next year is business with a CS
        minor, and I’ll keep building the whole way through.
      </p>
      <p class="stack-line mono reveal">Swift · SwiftUI · AppKit · TypeScript · Next.js · React · Supabase · Stripe · Python · FastAPI</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="about-facts reveal">
      {facts.map(([k, v]) => (<div><dt class="mono">{k}</dt><dd>{v}</dd></div>))}
      <div><dt class="mono">Local time</dt><dd><time class="num" data-clock-long>—</time></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, var(--col)) minmax(280px, 420px); gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px); align-items: start; justify-content: space-between; }
  .about-txt { display: grid; gap: 20px; }
  .about-p { color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 34em; }
  .about-p, .about-facts { transition-delay: 80ms; }
  .stack-line { font-size: var(--t-tiny); color: var(--ink-3); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 44ch; margin-top: 4px; }
  .about-facts { display: grid; margin: 0; padding-top: 36px; }
  .about-facts div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 12px 0; border-top: .5px solid rgb(var(--espresso) / .16); font-size: var(--t-small); }
  .about-facts div:last-child { border-bottom: .5px solid rgb(var(--espresso) / .16); }
  .about-facts dt { font-size: var(--t-tiny); color: var(--ink-3); padding-top: 2px; }
  .about-facts dd { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.45; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .about-facts { padding-top: 0; } }
</style>
